  "details": "Simple: it would be nice if I could put my notifications in other spots. \n\nFor example, I keep coming back to the idea that having the same level of control over where HUD elements are located like Face Mirrors would be good. (i.e. I could position my microphone icon to anywhere I want)\n\nWe already have ridiculous settings like the Custom Clock for VRC+ users, so it'd be nice if I could even position the microphone to be in the bottom-middle of my vision to be symmetrical. Or even more wacky, the microphone being position-able to the very center of the screen.",
